    <rect x="118" y="132" width="44" height="6" rx="2" fill="#2D1F45" opacity="0.5"/>
    <rect x="192" y="94" width="68" height="56" rx="6" fill="#1E1730" stroke="#8B5CF6" stroke-width="0.8"/>
    <rect x="196" y="98" width="60" height="28" rx="4" fill="#3D2F5F" opacity="0.4"/>
    <rect x="196" y="132" width="44" height="6" rx="2" fill="#3D2F5F" opacity="0.6"/>
    <rect x="270" y="94" width="54" height="56" rx="6" fill="#1E1730" stroke="#2D1F45" stroke-width="0.5"/>
  </svg>`,

  académico: `<svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 360 180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <rect width="360" height="180" fill="#1A1228"/>
    <rect x="30" y="14" width="300" height="152" rx="10" fill="#140E22" stroke="#2D1F45" stroke-width="0.8"/>
    <rect x="30" y="14" width="300" height="4" rx="2" fill="#7C3AED" opacity="0.4"/>
    <rect x="46" y="30" width="180" height="10" rx="4" fill="#2D1F45"/>
    <rect x="46" y="46" width="240" height="6" rx="3" fill="#2D1F45" opacity="0.6"/>
